ng"},{"type":"p","text":"Bridges:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Engineering","Analytics","BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Skills include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"dbt"},{"text":"Warehouses"},{"text":"ETL/ELT"},{"text":"BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. AI Agents for Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analytics professionals will increasingly build agents that can:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Query databases"},{"text":"Detect anomalies"},{"text":"Generate reports"},{"text":"Explain KPIs"},{"text":"Forecast trends"},{"text":"Produce executive summaries"},{"text":"Trigger workflows"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"The traditional Analytics Executive role will likely become increasingly automated."},{"type":"p","text":"Routine work such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic reporting"},{"text":"Repetitive dashboards"},{"text":"Simple SQL"},{"text":"Data summarisation"},{"text":"Standard KPI reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"will increasingly be handled by AI-enabled systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Human value will shift toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asking the right business questions"},{"text":"Defining metrics"},{"text":"Interpreting ambiguous results"},{"text":"Experiment design"},{"text":"Strategic recommendations"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"AI oversight"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Communicating insights to leadership"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the long-term target should not be:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Become someone who makes reports.\""},{"type":"p","text":"It should be:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Become someone who uses data and AI to improve business decisions.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Git"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Prompt engineering"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Natural-language BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"ETL/ELT"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Data governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","Statistics","Business Fundamentals"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Power BI","Python","Analytics Projects"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["ML","GenAI","Advanced Analytics","Internship"],"sep":"+","label":"Year 3"},{"type":"note","label":"Final Year","text":"End-to-end AI/Analytics project + strong portfolio"},{"type":"note","label":"0–2 years","text":"Analytics Executive / Data Analyst / BI Analyst"},{"type":"note","label":"3–5 years","text":"Senior Analyst / Business Analyst / Product Analyst"},{"type":"note","label":"5–8 years","text":"Analytics Lead / Analytics Manager"},{"type":"note","label":"8–15 years","text":"Head of Analytics / Director / Data & AI Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Data Science & AI","Advanced SQL","Power BI","Python","Statistics","GenAI","2–3 strong business projects","internship","excellent